blocks.en:
We further validate each rollout through three levels of judgment, which we view as test-time scaling for verification: a verifier V V the generator just synthesized; a LLM judge that semantically assesses the task, rubric, trajectory, and verifier results;
an agent judge using OpenCode that actively inspects the initial and final environments in multi turns ( Zhuge et al., 2024 ) .
Although agent judge can be costly, we only use it during synthesis to cross-check judgments and identify cases requiring verifier revision. The synthesized programmatic verifier is finally used as the reward function during RL.

blocks.zh:
我们通过三个层次的判断进一步验证每个阶段的推出,我们视其为核查的试验时间尺度:一个刚刚合成的核查器V V;一个模拟评估任务、标题、轨迹和核查结果的LLM法官;
使用OpenCode的代理法官,在多转弯时积极检查初始和最终环境(Zhuge等人,2024年)。
虽然代理法官可能费用高昂,但我们只是在综合时使用它来交叉检查判决和确定需要核查员修改的案件. 合成的程序验证器最终被用作RL期间的奖励功能.
